{"id":"f72d107b70d58355","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kleene-normal-form.md","title":"Kleene 计算历史正规形","display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene 计算历史正规形","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kleene-normal-form","aliases":["20-thm-kleene-normal-form"],"display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene 计算历史正规形","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 17.2.5；计算历史展开","source_pdf_pages":[261],"source_printed_pages":[234],"depends_on":["[[20-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-pr]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kleene-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kleene-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene 计算历史正规形"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 17.2.5；计算历史展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>261</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>234</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf6fbe6965e63f34\" href=\"?note=cf6fbe6965e63f34\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursive\">20-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PR}\">\\(\\mathcal{PR}\\)</span> 为全部有限元数原始递归函数族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y,z,t\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y,z,t\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\omega^3\\to2\">\\(T:\\omega^3\\to2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(U:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为待构造的原始递归函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf6fbe6965e63f34\" href=\"?note=cf6fbe6965e63f34\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursive\">20-df-primitive-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a>。</p>\n<p>历史码的最小性由断言内的有界全称公式表达；无满足条件的历史码时，右侧存在式为假。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists T\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap2^{\\omega^3}\\\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\\n\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\Bigl[\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in\\omega\\ [T(e,x,z)=1\\land(\\forall t&lt;z\\ T(e,x,t)=0)\\land U(z)=y]\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists T\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap2^{\\omega^3}\\\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\\n\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\Bigl[\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in\\omega\\ [T(e,x,z)=1\\land(\\forall t&lt;z\\ T(e,x,t)=0)\\land U(z)=y]\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>T 原始递归检查 z 是否为程序 e 输入 x 的合法正常停止历史；U 原始递归读出其输出。若没有历史，最小化发散；若有，最小历史的输出就是确定机器的输出。原书使用命中 1 的搜索约定，本式显式写出输出提取函数 U，不能把历史码本身当作函数值。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 17.2.5；计算历史展开；印刷页 234；PDF 第 261 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y,z,t\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\omega^3\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists T\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap2^{\\omega^3}\\\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\\n\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\Bigl[\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in\\omega\\ [T(e,x,z)=1\\land(\\forall t<z\\ T(e,x,t)=0)\\land U(z)=y]\\Bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cf6fbe6965e63f34","dc642dd12c05d028","a197f5a4c2eb61dc"]}